{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 18, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z/4 + Z/6 = Z/2 + Z/12: isomorphic, both Z/2 + Z/12\n  phi: (1, 0) -> (1, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 2)\n  psi = phi^-1: (1, 0) -> (2, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 5)\n  check: phi and psi are well defined (relations go to relations), psi phi = 1 and phi psi = 1 on generators\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 18, "ok": true, "cmd": "abiso", "ucas": "abiso Z/4 + Z/6, Z/2 + Z/12", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "abiso", "isomorphic": true, "phi_matrix": "[[1, 1], [3, 2]]", "psi_matrix": "[[-2, 1], [3, -1]]", "phi": "(1, 0) -> (1, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 2)", "psi": "phi^-1: (1, 0) -> (2, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 5)", "lhs": "Z/4 + Z/6", "value": "Z/2 + Z/12: isomorphic, both Z/2 + Z/12", "headline": "Z/4 + Z/6 = Z/2 + Z/12: isomorphic, both Z/2 + Z/12"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "phi and psi are well defined (relations go to relations), psi phi = 1 and phi psi = 1 on generators"}], "files": [], "text": "Z/4 + Z/6 = Z/2 + Z/12: isomorphic, both Z/2 + Z/12\n  phi: (1, 0) -> (1, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 2)\n  psi = phi^-1: (1, 0) -> (2, 3), (0, 1) -> (1, 5)\n  check: phi and psi are well defined (relations go to relations), psi phi = 1 and phi psi = 1 on generators\n"}, "isError": false}}
